Upstream-Name: Droidloom
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/denialwm/droidloom
@REPACK@Source: https://github.com/denialwm/droidloom/releases/download/packages/droidloom-source-@PKGVER@-@PKGREL@.tar.gz
@REPACK@Comment: The binaries in this package are the unchanged contents of the
@REPACK@ upstream Arch Linux ARM package @PACKAGE@ @PKGVER@-@PKGREL@, built from
@REPACK@ commit @COMMIT@. The complete license texts and notices shipped by upstream
@REBUILT@Source: https://github.com/EvilBorsch/droidloom/tree/@HOST_COMMIT@
@REBUILT@ https://github.com/denialwm/droidloom/releases/download/packages/droidloom-source-@PKGVER@-@PKGREL@.tar.gz
@REBUILT@Comment: The programs /usr/bin/droidloom* and
@REBUILT@ /usr/lib/droidloom/droidloom-package-helper are built from
@REBUILT@ https://github.com/EvilBorsch/droidloom commit
@REBUILT@ @HOST_COMMIT@, upstream's commit
@REBUILT@ @COMMIT@ with fixes for Debian and Ubuntu.
@REBUILT@ /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/60-droidloom-loop.rules is that
@REBUILT@ repository's too (packaging/eb-ubuntu), under the same license.
@REBUILT@ All other files are the unchanged contents of the upstream Arch
@REBUILT@ Linux ARM package @PACKAGE@ @PKGVER@-@PKGREL@. The complete license
@REBUILT@ texts and notices shipped by upstream
 are in /usr/share/doc/@PACKAGE@/licenses/ (upstream path
 /usr/share/licenses/@PACKAGE@/): LICENSE, LICENSES/, THIRD_PARTY.md and,
 where present, the Cargo crate notices (rust/), the Android notice catalog
 (Android-NOTICE.xml.gz) and the Mesa licenses (mesa/, Mesa-license.rst).
 .
@REPACK@ Corresponding source: Droidloom's own code is in the source tarball above.
@REBUILT@ Corresponding source: the fork's commit above; upstream's tarball for
@REBUILT@ the release it is based on.
 Android components are built from AOSP tag android-17.0.0_r1 (manifest
 commit 5bc9a7ce1cd78dd53613bbfd0ebf506e1e4adb0f) with Droidloom's patches;
 the base partitions are Android CI build 15885347 (CP2A.260605.016,
 aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone-userdebug); Mesa 26.3.0. The exact inputs are
 pinned in android/manifest/ of the Droidloom source.

