License: Apache-2.0 and BSD and MIT and GPL-3.0-or-later and others
 Android, Mesa and ANGLE code keeps its upstream licenses, predominantly
 Apache-2.0 (AOSP), MIT (Mesa) and BSD-3-Clause (ANGLE); Droidloom's patches
 and additions are GPL-3.0-or-later. The per-component notices are in
 Android-NOTICE.xml.gz and the mesa/ directory next to this file.
